title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Full page: Extracted tab and document
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: What Reader pulled out of the documents, field by field, next to the source document. A person can see the evidence for each field, correct a value, and page through the original.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Print and the page buttons act on an invented document; nothing prints.
---
start s1 "Open the full referral page\nTab 'Extracted' is the one it opens on"
screen sc1 "Extracted tab\n'Reader read 3 pages and found 13 fields. Click a field to see the evidence in the document.'"
toast t0 "Amber banner when a field is missing\n'Reader could not find every field. Add them by hand with the pencil, or ask the referrer.'"
screen sc2 "Field rows\nPatient, Age, Referring clinician, Credentials, NPI, Reason, Diagnoses, Requested service, Urgency, Order date, Insurance, Member ID, Contact"
process pRow "Each row shows a dot, the value and who set it\nDot: green at 90% and up, amber 75 to 89, red below 75 or not found\n'Extracted by Reader' or 'Edited by you', '95% sure' or 'Not found'"

group gRow "A field"
  click c1 "Click a field row,\nor its eye button 'Show … in the document'"
  process p1 "Row is outlined in green\nDocument switches to the right page\nEvidence block is boxed in red"
  click c2 "Click 'Why this value?'"
  process p2 "Reader found this on page 2 of the Referral form, in the section '…' with a quote\nNot found: 'Reader looked through every page and did not find …'\nAlso 'Confidence 95%. Nobody has edited it.'"
  click c3 "Click the pencil 'Edit …'"
  input i1 "Edit the value\nText box, big text box (reason, diagnoses), or a list for Urgency, Requested service and Insurance"
  decision d1 "Changed and not empty?"
  process p3 "'Save' is disabled"
  click c4 "Click 'Save' (Enter also saves a short text field)"
  click c5 "Click 'Cancel'"
  store st1 "Value is saved and marked 'Edited by you'\nReader's first reading is kept ('Reader first read … You changed it to …')\nChecks that depend on it run again"
  process p4 "What a saved change also does\nInsurance: the coverage result is cleared\nRequested service: the program changes\nPatient or Age: the card header changes"
  toast t1 "'Saved'\n'The field is now marked as edited by you.'\nTimeline 'You corrected Insurance'"
endgroup

group gDoc "Source document panel"
  screen sd "'Source document'\n'Fax from Northfield Counseling Associates, Mon 2:10 pm'"
  click c6 "Click 'Referral form' or 'Face sheet'"
  process p5 "Switches document, back to page 1, no highlight"
  click c7 "Click 'Previous' or 'Next'\n(two-page documents only)"
  process p6 "'Page 1 of 2' changes\nA single page reads 'Page 1 of 1' with no buttons"
  click c8 "Click a block of the document"
  process p7 "Block is boxed in red\nIf it matches a field, the Extracted tab opens on that row"
  click c9 "Click the print button 'Print the source document'"
  toast t2 "'Printing the original'\n'This is a demo. The faxed pages would open in your print dialog.'"
endgroup

s1 --> sc1 --> sc2 --> pRow
sc1 -.-> t0
sc2 --> c1 --> p1
sc2 --> c2 --> p2
sc2 --> c3 --> i1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| p3 --> c5
d1 -->|Yes| c4 --> st1 --> p4 --> t1
i1 --> c5
sc1 --> sd
sd --> c6 --> p5
sd --> c7 --> p6
sd --> c8 --> p7
sd --> c9 --> t2
c1 -.-> sd
